  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&#x2019;s Leadership, Empowerment and Resilience - LEAP Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is that refugee and host women and girls affected by crisis lead, participate in, and benefit from humanitarian response and recovery.

The key problem the LEAP project is addressing is the lack of voice and empowerment and lack of resilience to respond to current and future shocks among refugee women and girls especially in a context of protracted crises and prolonged displacement.</narrative>
  </description>
